# What differs from packages.why in the ARM (aarch64) image. "-name" is a
# package of the base list that the ARM base does not have; other lines are
# name, a tab, the reason, as in packages.why.
-limine-bios
-limine-bios-updater
-limine-efi-x86_64
-limine-tool
limine-efi-aarch64	Bootloader for UEFI boot. Part of the ARM base; a container does not use it
